cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Differential Evolution Optimised Deep Neural Network for
  Network Intrusion Detection
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Florish
    family-names: Adekogbe
    email: florishadekogbe@gmail.com
    affiliation: University of Lagos
repository-code: 'https://github.com/von-moyo/de-dnn-ids'
abstract: >-
  A hand-implemented DE/rand/1/bin differential evolution optimiser that
  searches the architecture and training hyperparameters of a deep neural
  network for network intrusion detection on the CSE-CIC-IDS2018 dataset,
  using validation macro-F1 as the fitness signal so that rare attack
  classes are not ignored.
keywords:
  - intrusion detection
  - differential evolution
  - hyperparameter optimisation
  - deep neural network
  - CSE-CIC-IDS2018
license: MIT
